Let the frozen zipimport inflate zstd (ZIP method 93).

The embedded stdlib is packed as zstd. The decoder is the _unpinzstd
builtin, fed the shared .unpin/zdict dictionary the packer trains (a
STORED entry, read through the plain path and cached per archive). The
lazy import mirrors _get_decompress_func, so a stray _unpinzstd.py in some
zip cannot recurse.

